The items is a list of 197, 130, and 1.
The size is 3.
The spot is 0.
The valid is 1.
Repeat while spot is less than size and valid is 1.
The lead is item spot of items.
The need is 0.
The startpos is spot.
If lead is less than 128, add 1 to spot.
If lead is at least 192 and lead is less than 224, set need to 1, add 2 to spot.
If lead is at least 224 and lead is less than 240, set need to 2, add 3 to spot.
If lead is at least 240 and lead is less than 248, set need to 3, add 4 to spot.
If lead is at least 128 and lead is less than 192, set valid to 0, add 1 to spot.
If lead is at least 248, set valid to 0, add 1 to spot.
For every step from 1 to need.
The index is startpos plus step.
If index is at least size, set valid to 0.
If index is less than size and item index of items is less than 128, set valid to 0.
If index is less than size and item index of items is more than 191, set valid to 0.

If valid is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
